### Independent health
GET http://localhost:5103/health

### Transport catalogue
GET http://localhost:5103/api/v1/transport-modes

### Normal transport POST does not create a schedule
POST http://localhost:5103/api/v1/transport-modes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "bike",
  "name": "Rental Bike",
  "description": "Preparation includes finding and unlocking the bike"
}

### Reusable point creation; sourceId is optional catalogue metadata
POST http://localhost:5103/api/v1/route-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "attraction",
  "name": "Museum Entrance",
  "address": "Montreal",
  "lat": 45.4987,
  "lon": -73.5793,
  "sourceId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Scheduled route using fixed seeded transport and points
POST http://localhost:5103/api/v1/transport-routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hotel to Museum by Bus",
  "transportModeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101",
  "startPointId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201",
  "destinationPointId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000202",
  "departureAt": "2026-10-10T08:00:00-04:00",
  "arrivalAt": "2026-10-10T12:00:00-04:00",
  "boardingMinutes": 15,
  "stops": [
    {
      "pointId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000203",
      "arrivalAt": "2026-10-10T09:00:00-04:00",
      "departureAt": "2026-10-10T10:30:00-04:00",
      "boardingMinutes": 20,
      "canLeaveVehicle": true
    }
  ]
}

### Seed schedule details; after POST use its returned Location instead
GET http://localhost:5103/api/v1/transport-routes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000301
